{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Every shrewd man</b> — one whose shrewdness is in his heart does his deed with knowledge." "<b>And a fool spreads his folly</b> — before others. Another interpretation: he acts for the sake of knowledge, that is, he makes shrewdness to teach knowledge."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:33.958429962Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}